<title>USA: Marcus hotel unit sets $1.8-mln upgrade.</title>
<headline>Marcus hotel unit sets $1.8-mln upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marcus Corp said Tuesday its Budgetel Inns chain will spend $1.8 million to improve guest entertainment capabilities at its 133 properties.</p>
<p>Budgetel will buy 4,500 25-inch television sets that will be compeletely installed by January 1. Market research indicates both business and leisure travelers prefer a larger television for their hotel rooms, said Budgetel.</p>
<p>Marcus owns and operates motels, movie theaters, hotel/resorts and restaurants.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
